      "batch_node": {
        "source": "plugins.samsite.grift.compliance-landing",
        "name": "Samsite Compliance landing v1.2 \u2014 KSI Components grouping + compact C/I/A + public dash",
        "description": "Consolidated landing-page bundle for /samsite/compliance. v1.2 re-upserts the KSI Components table panel: rows now group into sections (AWS components / External services / HTML artifacts / npm packages, with an 'Unexpected Name' catch-all) by matching the component name prefix via the table panel's declarative group_by engine; the Public column renders a neutral dash instead of a red \u2715 for non-public components (tickDash); and the C/I/A columns render compact L/M/H badges with a dash for not-applicable (ciaLevel). New batch_entity_id forces existing already-seeded sessions to re-apply the changed panel config (the skip guard is batch-id-keyed); node upserts remain idempotent on their own entity_ids. Still one atomic batch (page + 9 data-table panels + samsite-vdr-ingestion-health + their USES_PANEL edges) so hotlink validation sees the full graph; v1.1's nav-panel deletes are retained and idempotent."
      },
